# Wifi networks the Pi may join, one per line:
#
#   ssid|priority|psk|hidden
#
# Higher priority wins when several are in range. The phone hotspot sits above
# venue wifi on purpose: a hotspot only exists while someone switches it on, so
# switching it on becomes the manual override that pulls the Pi off the venue
# network.
#
# hidden must be yes for a network that does not broadcast its SSID. 10001 is
# the iPhone hotspot and is one of those — iOS stops beaconing it once nothing
# is attached, and NetworkManager only probes for a hidden network when the flag
# is set.
#
# Copy to networks.conf next to setup_network.py, fill in the real keys, then:
#   sudo chmod 0600 networks.conf
#   sudo /home/hb/Panel2Net/.venv/bin/python3 setup_network.py --dry-run
#   sudo /home/hb/Panel2Net/.venv/bin/python3 setup_network.py

10001|100|replace-me|yes
Y800Z_DA89|80|replace-me|no
NLan|50|replace-me|no
